doctorLines?: () => readonly string[] | Promise<readonly string[]>;
...
doctor: options.doctorLines ? await options.doctorLines() : ['Not run.'],
```
Handler already async? Currently `registerInvokeChannel('diagnosticsCopy', () => {...})` sync. Make `async () => { ... const doctor = await ... }`.
